	quest.20CF5931D85B8165.quest_desc: [
		"By placing a &9display case&r near a villager, you can get a &6Cobble Merchant&r. You can trade with them to spend your &6Cobble Dollars&r on pokeballs, pokemon tech, exp candies, and more!"
		""
		"&dYou can obtain more Cobble Dollars by trading relic coins and emeralds, completing raids, defeating trainers, and more!&r"
	]
	quest.20CF5931D85B8165.quest_subtitle: "What do I do with all this money?"
	quest.20CF5931D85B8165.title: "Cobble Merchant"
	quest.20F9CF8116277D12.quest_desc: ["Terastallization allows you to change your typing in a battle when you have a &9Tera Orb&r equipped. &6Your current tera type can be seen in the corner of your Pokemon's portrait in the overview screen&r."]
	quest.20F9CF8116277D12.quest_subtitle: "Change your typing!"
	quest.211F27AF98DE653D.quest_desc: [
		"&lHow can I fast travel?&r"
		""
		"There are two main methods of fast travel in this modpack, each serving different purposes:"
		"&6Via Romana&r and &bMirror Mirror&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Via Romana&r lets you create fast travel points between two locations using &esigns&r and &epath blocks&r. Simply craft a &9Charting Map&r, right click to start charting, then walk along a path made of valid path blocks to create a \"route\". &dRoutes can be connected to signs on either end&r, which can then be clicked to teleport to another sign. Route blocks include things like &epath blocks and planks&r, but also things like &ewater&r (to cross oceans), &esand&r (to cross deserts), and &elava&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Mirror Mirror&r provides an easier, albeit more expensive, method of fast travelling, but also a way to fast travel to other players. Craft a &9Magic Mirror&r, which you can do two things with:"
		""
		"1. To teleport to a player, simply hold right click. &dIt will teleport you to the closest player also holding a mirror&r."
		"2. To teleport to a \"waystone\", you can right click a &9lodestone&r with the mirror. &dThis will bind that mirror to that lodestone&r, allowing you to teleport back to it by holding right click with the mirror."
		""
		"&4Note that the mirror does NOT work cross dimension!&r"
	]
	quest.211F27AF98DE653D.quest_subtitle: "Methods of fast travel"
	quest.211F27AF98DE653D.title: "Where are the waystones?"
	quest.21615F4FCF87BB0C.quest_desc: ["A pokemon with the &9Dive move&r will generate treasure fishing loot."]
	quest.21615F4FCF87BB0C.title: "Dive Looter"
