	quest.22B9FFFCD8DB03FF.quest_desc: ["This quest page is filled with &erepeatable quests&r for difficult challenges. &5Completing them gives powerful rewards&r - so explore and defeat bosses for amazing loot!"]
	quest.22B9FFFCD8DB03FF.quest_subtitle: "So many adventures to be had!"
	quest.22BDB41418F52CA8.quest_desc: ["Ability Capsules and Ability Patches can be used to change a Pokemon's ability. Patches will give the Pokemon it's &6hidden ability&r, and Capsules will switch between its &6normal abilities&r."]
	quest.22BDB41418F52CA8.quest_subtitle: "Ability Training"
	quest.22BDB41418F52CA8.title: "Changing Abilities"
	quest.236874D8D3946807.quest_desc: [
		"This mod includes both &6Sophisticated Backpacks&r and &6Tom's Simple Storage&r."
		""
		"1. &9Backpacks&r can be equipped on your back or in a curios slot. They let you carry more on your travels! You can also install many upgrades to do things like auto feed you or pick up items directly into the backpack!"
		""
		"2. &6Tom's Simple Storage&r allows you to access large amounts of storage from a single interface. Start by crafting an &9Inventory Connector&r, and place it next to your storage blocks. Placing a &9Terminal&r on the connector allows you to access the contents of all those storage blocks in one place!"
	]
	quest.236874D8D3946807.quest_subtitle: "So many items, where do I put them?"
	quest.236874D8D3946807.title: "Storage"
