	quest.2EAE3F12BF27C3FF.quest_desc: [
		"There are multiple different ways you can buff your Pokemon in battle, such as &6Mega Evolutions, Dynamaxing, and more&r. These require certain equipped items to use."
		""
		"&6&n&lHow to Use These In Battle&r&r&r"
		""
		"&6When you are in a battle, in the moves screen, you will see some buttons to the right of the \"back\" button. Before you select an ability, click one of those buttons - it should become lit up - then pick your move. This will activate that battle mechanic!&r"
	]
