	quest.3F7A0894A827A50F.quest_desc: [
		"Different foods, like &6aprijuice (and items like Poke Snacks and Poke Bait!)&r, will take a variety of different seasonings. &6Seasonings will change the stats a food will provide for your Pokemon&r. For example, some berries will increase or decrease which stats are changed when making aprijuice."
		""
		"&9The Cobblemon \"Seasoning\" wiki page provides details of what each seasoning does&r, as there are too many to detail here. Lots of berries, some vanilla foods, and more can be used as seasoning."
		""
		"[ { \"text\": \"Cobblemon Seasoning Wiki\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://wiki.cobblemon.com/index.php/Seasoning\" } } ]"
