	quest.44E97FD5EB6504D1.quest_subtitle: "Unleash your rage!"
	quest.466B656D18E9B574.quest_subtitle: "Persim and Cheri"
	quest.487D47C3CF67F31F.quest_desc: ["The Z Ring allows Pokemon holding Z items to gain the effects of that Z item."]
	quest.487D47C3CF67F31F.quest_subtitle: "Now you can use Z Moves!"
	quest.49420331B644DB75.quest_desc: ["Mega Evolving your Pokemon &6raises it's stats and changes its form, and may change it's typing as well&r. In order to mega evolve your pokemon, you must have some form of &9Mega Bracelet&r equipped, and your Pokemon must be holding it's &9mega stone (xxx-ite, like aerodactylite)&r. &cNot all Pokemon can mega evolve!&r"]
	quest.49420331B644DB75.quest_subtitle: "Now you can Mega Evolve!"
	quest.497482FD86299B36.quest_subtitle: "Increase level cap to 46!"
	quest.497482FD86299B36.title: "Poke Maniac"
	quest.4A10FFECDC573B71.quest_subtitle: "Support your friends!"
	quest.4A10FFECDC573B71.title: "Holy Priest"
	quest.4A2DA1F980E153E3.quest_subtitle: "Go with the flow!"
	quest.4BEE27A992FE942D.quest_desc: ["Mochis are a way to &6increase your Pokemon's EVs&r, &cbut they will fill up your Pokemon's stomach!&r"]
	quest.4BEE27A992FE942D.quest_subtitle: "EV Training"
	quest.4BEE27A992FE942D.title: "Mochis"
	quest.4C7F34D481ADDBE7.quest_subtitle: "Touga and Occa"
	quest.4D6EC2597EB92E11.quest_desc: ["Do you find yourself running out of PP when battling? &aPP Up and PP Max&r will increase how many charges of a move a Pokemon has."]
	quest.4D6EC2597EB92E11.quest_subtitle: "PP Training"
	quest.4D6EC2597EB92E11.title: "Increasing your PP"
	quest.4DADA5C7AB7C1F9D.quest_desc: [
		"After selecting you class in a Spell Binding Table, &6you can then add new spells to your spellbook in that table!&r Adding new spells requires &9lapis&r, &alevels&r, and &ebookshelves&r &6(like an enchanting table)&r. &lNote that you will end up needing more than 15 bookshelves to obtain the highest level spells!&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Each level, you will have the choice between &62 different spells&r. Which spell you pick will determine your \"subclass\", and will guide your playstyle. For example, the warrior class has spells focused on being a supporting tank (like shout), or spells focused on being more of a berserker (like charge). &cThe skilltree will also buff each of these spells - make sure you spec into the spells you want!&r"
		""
		"Each class also has &62 different final armor sets&r, each buffing one subclass or the other. &cMake sure you craft the right one!&r"
	]
	quest.4DADA5C7AB7C1F9D.quest_subtitle: "How will you fight your foes?"
	quest.4DADA5C7AB7C1F9D.title: "Pick your Path"
	quest.518207644B829A85.quest_desc: ["&#FF681FMiltank, Bouffalant, or Tauros&r will automatically generate leather and raw beef."]
	quest.518207644B829A85.title: "Cow Loot Generator"
	quest.518B8D7ACCA36E38.title: "Fifth Badge"
	quest.51A276E5375829AA.quest_desc: [
		"&lJoin a Raid!&r"
		""
		"Across the world, you will find &6crystals with a beacon beam&r. These are &9Cobblemon Raids&r! Raids are tiered 1 through 7, with each tier getting harder. Right click the crystal to join, then pick one Pokemon to fight - &cyou can only use one&r! You can also complete raids with a friend!"
		""
		"Raids will often contain unique Pokemon, and can be a great way to fill your PokeDex. &6Higher tiers will have rarer Pokemon&r. Each dimension will be more likely to contain higher and higher tier raids!"
	]
	quest.51A276E5375829AA.quest_subtitle: "Why is this guy so hard??"
	quest.51A276E5375829AA.title: "Join a Raid"
	quest.51B837C2AD5BAEBA.quest_desc: ["This page is dedicated to the various ways you can strengthen your Pokemon, including &5EV training&r, &9Megas&r, and more!"]
	quest.51B837C2AD5BAEBA.quest_subtitle: "Let's make our Pokemon stronger!"
	quest.51B837C2AD5BAEBA.title: "Training your Pokemon"
	quest.51EBAE5E3D873796.quest_desc: ["A &dpoison type&r Pokemon will pick up nearby arrows and coat them in poison."]
	quest.51EBAE5E3D873796.title: "Fletcher"
	quest.52C3A6D9F3CAAD85.quest_desc: ["A &#FF00FFfairy type&r Pokemon will harvest fully grown mint crops."]
	quest.52C3A6D9F3CAAD85.title: "Mint Harvester"
	quest.53734F4B0FA40CB2.quest_subtitle: "Catch one of every pokemon type!"
	quest.53734F4B0FA40CB2.title: "So Many Colors!"
	quest.53746901E034932B.quest_desc: ["A &abug type&r Pokemon can harvest fully grown apricorns."]
	quest.53746901E034932B.title: "Apricorn Harvester"
	quest.544D09FF3CB8A238.quest_subtitle: "Persim and Aspear"
	quest.55909F57F5EA1289.quest_desc: ["[ \"Learn more about Dynamaxxing \", { \"text\": \"here\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"63149FEE47D6661E\" } }, \"!\" ]"]
	quest.55909F57F5EA1289.quest_subtitle: "That's one BIG Pokemon..."
	quest.55909F57F5EA1289.title: "Dynamax"
	quest.55E234E662F22153.quest_desc: [
		"This modpack includes &6Cobbleworkers&r - Pokemon allowed to roam in a &9pasture block&r can generate items for you from different nearby blocks, refuel furnaces, fill cauldrons, and more!"
		""
		"[ \"You can learn more about different jobs \", { \"text\": \"here\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"650F4941417881B3\" } }, \".\" ]"
	]
	quest.55E234E662F22153.quest_subtitle: "Let Pokemon help out around your base!"
	quest.55E234E662F22153.title: "Cobbleworkers"
	quest.56CDACAD94DCCAF4.quest_desc: [
		"Obtain a &9Trainer Card&r, then seek out a &6Trainer Association villager&r (they spawn around you, especially in villages) to pick your path! Once you've picked your path, defeat trainers and earn badges until you have reached the top!"
		""
		"&cNote that Space and Apocalypse are special, extremely difficult paths, and the order you earn badges does not line up with this quest progression!&r &4It is HIGHLY recommended to complete one of the base Radical Cobblemon Trainer paths before doing Space or Apocalypse!&r"
	]
	quest.56CDACAD94DCCAF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain a trainer card, and choose your path!"
	quest.56CDACAD94DCCAF4.title: "Time to Battle!"
	quest.56E6A8C31242379C.quest_subtitle: "Beat a tier 3 raid"
	quest.56E6A8C31242379C.title: "Raid Tier 3"
	quest.57C2416EE1F268D0.quest_subtitle: "Strike down your foes!"
	quest.57CB3EDE5417FAD8.quest_subtitle: "Iapapa and Pinap"
	quest.57D3BBF35A03037A.quest_desc: ["An &bice type&r Pokemon will fill empty cauldrons with powdered snow."]
	quest.57D3BBF35A03037A.title: "Snow Generator"
	quest.58C35C1DAA129BC8.quest_subtitle: "Find your target!"
	quest.597D0D208BD7239D.quest_desc: [
		"Many of the items you use to train your Pokemon are cooked up in a campfire pot or a cooking pot. "
		""
		"Be sure to check EMI for exact recipes, as well as which pots to cook things in!"
	]
	quest.597D0D208BD7239D.quest_subtitle: "The core to crafting your training items!"
	quest.597D0D208BD7239D.title: "What's Cooking?"
	quest.5A28A1B736508A5C.quest_desc: ["\"Fullness\" is a mechanic that &cprevents you from feeding your Pokemon huge amounts of foods in a short time&r. Different foods, like aprijuice and mochis, will fill up your Pokemon's fullness bar. &cWhen full, you cannot feed them more food&r. &6The fullness bar will naturally decrease over time.&r"]
	quest.5A28A1B736508A5C.quest_subtitle: "Why can't I keep feeding my Pokemon?"
	quest.5A5158FD1C50D0F4.quest_desc: ["A &2grass type&r Pokemon will harvest fully grown Cobblemon berry trees."]
	quest.5A5158FD1C50D0F4.title: "Berry Harvester"
	quest.5ADB795F3A4B1204.quest_desc: ["These X items can be used to &6temporarily&r buff different stats in battle. "]
	quest.5ADB795F3A4B1204.quest_subtitle: "Temporary buffs in Battle"
	quest.5ADB795F3A4B1204.title: "X Items"
	quest.5B13913C079A277E.quest_subtitle: "Cast ice spells!"
	quest.5B13913C079A277E.title: "Frost Mage"
	quest.5B62C0A9AE6A0A3C.quest_subtitle: "Use your spell book to cast a frost spell!"
	quest.5B62C0A9AE6A0A3C.title: "Cast a Frost Spell"
	quest.5B926EA99FA1D40F.quest_desc: ["As you progress, you may notice &9mobs have levels attached to them&r. These levels are influenced by location, dimension, playtime, and others. Higher level mobs will be much harder, so keep an eye out and be careful!"]
	quest.5B926EA99FA1D40F.quest_subtitle: "Things are heating up..."
	quest.5B926EA99FA1D40F.title: "Mob Levels"
	quest.5C2F8A7376145C47.quest_subtitle: "Charge into battle!"
	quest.5C49D5333A338885.quest_subtitle: "Ride a pokemon!"
	quest.5C49D5333A338885.title: "They Can Fly Now??"
	quest.5CA9BABA18EBB1A3.title: "Unlock All Water Spells"
	quest.5CE2AB132C9E1154.title: "Cast a Fire Spell"
	quest.5D7719B4DFE8D21A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6RPG Series&r set of mods introduces a collection of combat classes, from &dmages to knights to archers&r. You can use a &9Spell Binding Table&r to pick your initial class, as well as unlock more spells as you go along. You can open the &6skill tree&r to further enhance your skills! &c(default K)&r"
		""
		"[ \"You can learn more about the different classes \", { \"text\": \"here\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4DADA5C7AB7C1F9D\" } }, \".\" ]"
	]
	quest.5D7719B4DFE8D21A.quest_subtitle: "So many classes to pick!"
	quest.5D7719B4DFE8D21A.title: "Classes"
	quest.5DD4F2D283441D5E.quest_subtitle: "Smite down your enemies!"
	quest.5E3302F2AD1E5A03.quest_desc: ["A Power Spot allows you to Dynamax outside of a raid when placed."]
	quest.5FAC367BD092F5F1.quest_subtitle: "Wiki and Bluk"
	quest.5FDAB56B2B67F26F.quest_subtitle: "Catch your first shiny pokemon!"
	quest.5FDAB56B2B67F26F.title: "Ooo Shiny!"
	quest.6022B1164BD3BE5C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6022B1164BD3BE5C.quest_subtitle: "Cast powerful spells with runes from afar!"
	quest.60CBDF91033DF153.quest_subtitle: "Persim and Chesto"
	quest.618B3F2C29F0B8A0.quest_subtitle: "Hopo and Occa, Passho, Wacan, Rindo, Yache, Chople, Kebia, Shuca, Coba, Payapa, Tanga, Charti, Kasib, Haban, Colbur, Babiri, Chilan, or Roseli"
	quest.62B01D90F6A3124B.quest_subtitle: "Watmel and Qualot"
	quest.630953A80B4B9550.quest_subtitle: "Rabuta and Babiri"
	quest.63149FEE47D6661E.quest_desc: ["Dynamaxing your Pokemon &6increases their stats, makes them bigger, and gives them special, super strong moves&r. Normally you can only Dynamax inside Raids, but you can place down a &9Power Spot&r to Dynamax outside them."]
	quest.63149FEE47D6661E.quest_subtitle: "Now you can Dynamax!"
	quest.63FDB60B9561A37A.title: "Second Badge"
	quest.64EFF01B932B857A.quest_subtitle: "Cornn and Passho"
	quest.650F4941417881B3.quest_desc: [
		"Pokemon in pasture blocks can help out around your base! There are a multitude of different jobs, which are expanded upon on this quest page. You can also check the Cobbleworkers wiki for more details about the jobs. "
		""
		"Pokemon in pasture blocks will generate items in various ways depending on their job, and will then seek out a nearby chest to deposit those items into. &cIf they cannot reach a chest for whatever reason, they will simply drop their items on the ground&r. Pokemon that require a block to work, like crop harvesters, will look for blocks within &68 blocks&r of their pasture block."
	]
	quest.650F4941417881B3.title: "Cobbleworkers"
	quest.6516544B7A002383.quest_subtitle: "You've found them all! Did you have fun..."
	quest.65425B35DB5FF594.quest_desc: [
		"Berries in Cobblemon are used in all sorts of recipes, and are imperative to maxxing out your Pokemon's stats."
		""
		"This quest page serves as a guide to berry mutations (which can be also tracked in EMI) as well as a way to track what berries you have obtained so far."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e&lHow to Use This Page:&r&r"
		""
		"&6The top half of the page is dedicated to all the natural berries. These are berries you can find out in the world, spawned naturally. You can also get some of these from rustling spots.&r"
		""
		"&6The bottom half is dedicated to all the mutated berries. These berries are made by growing 2 different berries next to each other. You can check the required berries to make these mutated berries both via hovering over the quest, and by checking the dependencies of the quest.&r"
		""
		"&6Note that some berries can be made from different collections of berries - check the subtitle for which berry combinations work.&r"
	]
	quest.66F63154DCB0FEA5.title: "Even Further Beyond!"
	quest.67EB9C03BD740B38.quest_subtitle: "Your first lesson"
	quest.67EB9C03BD740B38.title: "Craft a TM"
